{"id":"n28428-5-7","stage":3,"title":"내보내다 · 释放","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28428-5-7-1","ko":"저를 좀 여기에서 내보내 주세요!","zh":"请让我从这里出去吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저를","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내보내","meaning":"释放","explanation":"내보내다：释放；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"내보내다","audio":"/audio/c2c51426c0ebeeb8f180.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28428","senseId":"5","lemma":"내보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요!","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"c2c51426c0ebeeb8","term":"내보내다","zh":"释放","audio":"/audio/c2c51426c0ebeeb8f180.mp3","entryId":"28428","definition":"把人从关押的地方放出去。","pronunciation":["내ː보내다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/809410c10a0aff26e3c8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28428-5-7-2","ko":"안 돼. 보호자가 올 때까지 여기서 나갈 생각하지 마.","zh":"不行。在监护人到来之前，别想离开这里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보호자가","meaning":"监护人","explanation":"보호자：监护人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"보호자","audio":"/audio/0a3bf55bf9735ba52731.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60039","senseId":"2","lemma":"보호자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"15","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때까지","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나갈","meaning":"离开","explanation":"나가다：离开；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"10","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각하지","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각하다：想，决定；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"0a3bf55bf9735ba5","term":"보호자","zh":"监护人","audio":"/audio/0a3bf55bf9735ba52731.mp3","entryId":"60039","definition":"在法律上对未成年人拥有父母的权利和义务的人。","pronunciation":["보ː호자"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达某个时间或时期。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间，或曾所属的地方出去。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"6ffd015ff4c3322a","term":"생각하다","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3","entryId":"66376","definition":"内心决心做某事。","pronunciation":["생가카다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d525be3014a98d31718.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28428","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8694,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不行。在监护人到来之前，别想离开这里。","您要咖啡还是红茶？","请让我从这里出去吧！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不行。在监护人到来之前，别想离开这里。","请让我从这里出去吧！","您要咖啡还是红茶？"],"answer":0}]}
